            <ArticleTitle>Pain relief after tonsillectomy. Effect of benzydamine hydrochloride spray on postoperative pain relief after tonsillectomy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>990-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The efficacy of benzydamine hydrochloride (Difflam) spray to relieve pain from postoperative tonsillectomy was assessed, but it was found that it did not relieve the symptoms after operation when compared to matching placebo.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
